# =============================================================================
# MuleTrace AI — Workspace Environment Setup Guide
# =============================================================================
# MuleTrace AI is divided into:
#   1. backend/  (FastAPI REST API & Detection Engines)
#   2. frontend/ (Next.js 14 SOC Investigation Dashboard)
#
# QUICK START:
#
# Backend:
#   cd backend
#   cp .env.example .env
#   pip install -r requirements.txt
#   python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
#
# Frontend:
#   cd frontend
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#   npm install
#   npm run dev
#
# Access:
#   - Frontend UI: http://localhost:3000
#   - Backend API: http://localhost:8000
#   - Swagger Docs: http://localhost:8000/api/v1/docs
# =============================================================================
